  "changeNote": [
    "对齐 API 治理宪章：OPERATION Fragment 保留 PATCH 语义，POST 降级为实现层关注点",
    "IMPORT/EXPORT scope 改为 GLOBAL，对齐 scenes 规范",
    "新增子实体（resume/education/team-member）CRUD 操作",
    "新增 TRANSFER_CONTACT 联系人转移操作（自定义 authzAction=TRANSFER）",
    "标准 CRUD（LIST/READ）由发布服务从 MODEL.apiConfig 自动生成",
    "EDIT httpMethod PATCH→POST 降级 + actionPath:update",
    "新增 EXPORT_FILTERED 高级筛选导出（POST /contacts/export-filtered，model 参数路由）"
